# Zenodo mint / push — user only

The user always performs Zenodo **mint**, **remint**, **publish**, `--push-metadata`, and PDF upload (GUI or CLI).

Agents must **not**:

- mint or remint Zenodo deposits
- push metadata or files to Zenodo
- publish deposits
- run `publish_canon_zenodo.py` / GUI flows that hit the network for mint/push unless the user explicitly asks in that chat

Agents **may**:

- seed a local mint-ready `.zenodo.json` (no `deposit_id` / `doi`)
- clear borrowed `\paperdoi` in edition tex
- refresh local description text offline
- register `EDITION_CONFIG` / keywords so the user's GUI can mint later
